communication_activities:
Our communication and awareness-raising activities related to EU policies are articulated on 3 levels: 
1) Reforest'Action co-organizes every year since 2021 the Global Forest Summit, a civil-society and knowledge-driven event that puts forests at the top of the international agenda by bringing together international leaders from various backgrounds and that deals with many forest issues (deforestation, forest restoration, sustainable management...) including European ones. Virginijus Sinkevicius, European Commissioner for the Environment participated in the 2021 and 2022 GFS editions; 
2) Reforest'Action raises awareness on the EU's 3 Billion tree planting Pledge by 2030; 
3) Reforest'Action co-organizes citizen plantations in France in cooperation with the European Commission Representation in France.

