communication_activities:
Main forms of activities: 
• Provide information to the consumers through it is own media (Weekly Newsletter ACTIVE CONSUMERS, informative brochures and books, website www.aktivnipotrebiteli.bg) and through general media (press conferences, press releases, interviews, articles etc); 
• Comparative testing and research; 
• Running advice bureaux; 
• Campaigning (BNAAC is actively involved in many national campaigns); 
