Mobile and integrated autonomous situational awareness system SurveilSPIRE;
Mobile surveillance and sensors system CAIMAN;
Cutting edge AI-powered C2 software; 
C-UAS EIRSHIELD;
Unmanned Surface Vessel (USV) EUROMITE for various naval missions.
We are well-known partner for security and defence R&D programmes such as the European Defence Fund, and we are validated by European Commission.

