goals:
Ruthenia vzw aims to promote, support and disseminate cultural activities and products, both in Belgium and internationally. The organisation seeks to familiarise a broad public with art and culture, while also providing a platform for specialised cultural exchange.

Its core activities include:

organising festivals, conferences, rituals, seminars, lectures and other creative events;

promoting education and training through schools and other learning activities;

researching, preserving and engaging the public with ethnographic and historical heritage, including pre-Christian sanctuaries and ethno-rituals;

publishing and producing literary, musical and audiovisual works across various artistic disciplines;

setting up exhibitions, concerts, masterclasses and workshops.

The organisation may also carry out any activities that directly or indirectly contribute to the achievement of these objectives.

