goals:
Our organization's mission is to support the development of sustainable, circular, and export-oriented industrial sectors in the Western Balkans through private sector investments, technical assistance, and engagement with EU green transition goals.

Our objectives are to:

Facilitate industrial transformation through the adoption of clean technologies and digital manufacturing tools;

Enable the transition from linear to circular production models by upcycling waste streams into value-added products;

Support import substitution through the development of high-quality, locally produced goods;

Strengthen the export capacity of SMEs in alignment with EU market requirements and the Green Deal;

Promote social inclusion and decent job creation, particularly in rural and industrial zones undergoing economic transition.

