2.1	The objectives of the Foundation are:
a.	to incubate a technological and financial ecosystem that supports the development of open social protocols and related applications, by developing a range of funding instruments, public interest technology infrastructures, and applications for public use;
b.	to advance technical specifications, governance, and standards of ATProto and other protocols that support an open web, as well as related policies;
c.	to advocate for and support diverse and democratic cultural and civic participation and the integrity of public information, to help drive demand for technologies built on ATProto and other open social applications;
