communication_activities:
RC SFPA carries out communication and outreach activities related to EU foreign policy, European integration, democracy, resilience, climate and energy policy, enlargement and neighbourhood policy, and broader EU governance issues.

These activities include:
- organisation of international expert conferences, roundtables, policy dialogues and public discussions;
- publication of policy papers, analytical studies, commentaries and expert recommendations;
- stakeholder consultations and dissemination activities within EU-funded and international projects;
- participation in expert discussions, consultations and conferences involving representatives of EU institutions, Member States, academia and civil society;
- cooperation with European think tanks, research institutions and policy networks;
- communication and awareness-raising activities related to EU policies and strategic priorities.

RC SFPA regularly engages with representatives of EU institutions and bodies, including the European Commission, European Parliament, European External Action Service and EU agencies, primarily through expert consultations, conferences, project cooperation, policy discussions and dissemination activities connected to European policy developments and EU-funded initiatives.

