- provide awareness of the technology and transformation potential of the Syndicate through workshops, organization of conferences and exhibitions where institutions like European Commission, European Space Agency and other national space agencies can take part in;
- advocate for transparency and equilibrium in public effort space contracts : an observatory of consolidated figures of the Syndicate will be performed yearly;
