goals:
Generation Climate Europe (GCE) is the largest coalition of youth-led networks on climate and environmental issues at the European level. GCE unites the largest youth-led networks in Europe bringing together 381 national organisations across 46 countries in Europe. Uniting European youth networks, GCE creates a platform for the youth to advocate for a just and green transition in Europe.

GCE aims to:

1) Facilitate internal coordination and collaboration between our Member Organisations;
2) Empower young people to meaningfully engage in EU decision-making processes on climate, environmental and sustainability issues;
3) Advocate for stronger action on the environment and climate by and in the European Union that proactively and regularly includes the voices of young people.

