communication_activities:
PUBLICATIONS: 

"EAA Implementation Report 2025" Part I Beyond Compliance published November 2025 at Forum Dostępności conference (see: https://baforum.pl/a,198,beyond-compliance-the-eaa-implementation-report-part-one-landscape-and-progress); 

Part II publication mid-February 2026 - the first comprehensive European report on EAA implementation based on interviews with ILO, IAAP, EDF, Zero Project and major stakeholders. 

Report: Digital Accessibility in Polish Business 2023 (see: https://baforum.pl/2023/)

Podcast series "Dostępność przy mikrofonie" (Accessibility at the Microphone): episodes on EAA business implications, plain language, financial sector accessibility with BLIK and Financial Ombudsman (6 episodes, 2025).

POLICY WORK: 

Monthly participation in EAA Working Group (Trialog format) bringing together market surveillance authorities (ministries, financial ombudsman etc.), business and disability organizations. 

BAF co-authored Recommendations No. 1-6 for Polish Accessibility Act implementation, officially adopted by Resolution of the National Accessibility Council (Rada Dostępności) in July 2025 and published by PFRON as supervisory authority (etc. see: https://dostepnosc.pfron.org.pl/dostepnosc-produktow-i-uslug/nadzor-rynku/wytyczne-i-dobre-praktyki). Ongoing work on Recommendations No. 7-10.

EU-LEVEL EVENTS: 

"BAF in Brussels: Inauguration of a New Era of Accessibility in Europe" (July 2025); 

Conference "Equality, Europe!" organized by Polish Chancellery during Polish EU Council Presidency (July 2025); 

IAAP European Workshop on harmonised standard EN 301 549 (May 2025).

Annual meeting of the National Coalitions for Digital Skills and Jobs (July 2024),

NATIONAL EVENTS AND PRESENTATIONS: 

Ministry of Funds Conference "Włączamy dostępność" on EAA business implications (June 2025); 

CMO Summit at META on EAA as competitive advantage (June 2025); 

Mobile Trends Conference on EAA impact on mobile applications (March 2025); 

Plain Language Days "No accessibility without comprehensibility" (July 2025); 

FOB Webinar on Polish Accessibility Act (June 2025).

MEMBER ENGAGEMENT: 

Monthly BAF member meetings with workshops (topics: plain language, accessible documents, ESG and accessibility, PFRON supervision). 

BAF Advisory Council (Rada Konsultacyjna) monthly meetings since August 2025 with Santander Bank Polska. 

Growing membership: InPost, YES Jewellery, Credit Agricole, BLIK, Rossmann joined in 2025.

