goals:
NGO “Brave Ukraine” operates publicly through the initiative and project platform “Arm Women Now”, which focuses on women in the security and defence sector. The organisation focuses on improving conditions, equipment, institutional support, and visibility of women serving in the security and defence sector, based on operational experience and evidence-based research.

Its activities include:

* research and analysis related to servicewomen and operational effectiveness;
* advocacy for gender-responsive approaches within the security and defence sector;
* international policy dialogue and cooperation with governmental, military, and international stakeholders;
* exhibitions, public discussions, and awareness-raising activities related to women in defence and securit

