NGO “Brave Ukraine” is the legally registered entity operating the initiative “Arm Women Now”.

“Arm Women Now” is a project platform and public initiative focused on:
– women in defence and security;
– military adaptation and equipment;
– research and advocacy;
– exhibitions and public education;
– support for servicewomen and women veterans;
– international cooperation in the framework of Women, Peace and Security-related activities.

The initiative operates through a multidisciplinary team including project managers, researchers, volunteers, veterans, designers, communications specialists, and external subject-matter experts.

The organisation cooperates with affiliated stakeholders and institutional partners from the Ukrainian security and defence sector, civil society organisations, research communities, veteran initiatives, and international partners engaged in security and defence-related activities.

