The organisation’s activities are relevant to several European Union initiatives and legislative frameworks related to artificial intelligence, digital transformation, cybersecurity, data governance, and advanced digital technologies.
Relevant EU legislative proposals, regulations, and policy initiatives include:
- Regulation laying down harmonised rules on artificial intelligence (Artificial Intelligence Act);
- European Strategy for Data;
- Regulation on harmonised rules on fair access to and use of data (Data Act);
- Regulation on European data governance (Data Governance Act);
