EU rules implementing the Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora, in particular regarding Pernambuco wood (Paubrasilia echinata), traceability and registration of stocks, and practicable requirements for legally acquired existing stocks, musical instrument bows, repairs and cross-border trade;

