goals:
LLC "PIC "Deviro"  is a Ukrainian company specialising in the development and manufacturing of unmanned aerial systems (UASs). The organisation’s goal is to develop and deliver innovative, reliable and cost-effective unmanned systems, strengthen domestic technological and manufacturing capabilities, and contribute to the development of Ukraine’s and international defence sector.
Expectations:
1) establishing the conditions and guidelines for closer cooperation between the European and Ukrainian defence industries, under the leadership of national governments and EU bodies;
2) creating a network of approved manufacturers and technology suppliers that contribute to defence development;
3) clarifying the financial frameworks for funding technological development.

