Horia Hulubei National Institute for R&D in Physics and Nuclear Engineering (Institutul National de Cercetare-Dezvoltare pentru Fizica si Inginerie Nucleara Horia Hulubei - IFIN-HH) is committed to the advancement of the knowledge in physics, especially in sub-atomic physics, and of the use of nuclear physics for the benefit of our society, through advanced research and professional services and expertise. Our highly rated research results in some of the most exciting areas of physics can be a source of scientific knowledge and expertise to our community and an inspiring example to the young generation. Our main mission consists of:
