goals:
The Food Collective is a non-profit organisation whose purpose is to:
a. accelerate the transformational change on, including but not limited to, the fields of food and agriculture;
b. bring business leaders together to create systems-level change through collective action;
c. collaborate cross-sectoral on key material issues on, including but not limited to, the fields of food and agriculture;
d. allow governments, philanthropy, civil society and businesses to pool resources efficiently to drive public benefit;
e. and to do anything which is, in the widest sense of the word, connected with or may be conducive to the attainment of these objectives.

