Established in 2001, Eunomia Research & Consulting Ltd (‘Eunomia’) is a Bristol-based, independent consultancy dedicated to adding value to organisations through the delivery of improved outcomes. We combine practical experience with academic excellence, to offer creative solutions that make sustainable choices the obvious ones.
Eunomia employs over 105 consultants in the UK, and has offices in Bristol, London, Manchester, Scotland, Brussels and Auckland. Working throughout the UK, other EU member states and beyond, Eunomia’s consultants have experience and expertise in environmental, technical and commercial disciplines. 
Eunomia works across a range of environmental service areas, including:
•	Waste management practice and policy;
•	Low carbon and renewable energies;
•	Resource efficiency;
•	Marine planning; and
•	Climate change adaptation.
