goals:
FMSB seeks to improve the transparency, fairness and effectiveness of global wholesale markets by:
• acting in a collaborative and agile fashion across all market interests;
• harnessing the market position, thought leadership, technical knowledge and expertise of members;
• forward-looking, alert to emerging risks to markets and market structures on the horizon and aware of disruptive impacts of innovation; and
• promoting adherence to expert standards and individual understanding of the importance of fair and effective markets.
By improving their transparency, fairness and effectiveness, FMSB seeks to support well-functioning, trusted global wholesale financial markets that in turn support sustainable economic growth for governments, corporations and investors.

Defining a stable, balanced and responsible market for the provision of financial services;
Ensuring compliance with applicable legislation;
Full compliance with the rights and obligations of the parties involved in the process of selling non-banking financial products and services;
Fair competition between financial service providers;
The fight to prevent and combat money laundering and financial fraud;
Sustainable economic growth to support Romania's development;
ALB Romania aims to be an honest and reliable interface between the providers of these services and their clients, authorities, mass media and/or other professional organizations.

