Research and development, Transport, harmonisation, security, deployment, engeineering support in the railway activitites.

Currently, under the leadership of EUG, a consortium was formed to provide the expertise for the work in the System Pillar of EU-Rail, a joint initiative from the European Commission and members of the railway sector (railway companies and suppliers). EUG, together with EULYNX, aims to develop a target architecture for CCS in line with the ideas developed in 2017 to develop a reference CCS architecture.  

The consortium has entered into three framework contracts with EU-RaiL (EU-Rail.OP.01.22): 
•	Lot 1: provision of experts for the System Pillar Core Group; 
•	Lot 2: work on the specifications for the operational concept and target architecture of the future railway system; 
•	Lot 3: maintenance of the TSI CCS specifications.

goals:
Transparência Eleitoral Brasil es una organización no gubernamental sin fines de lucro que, desde su fundación en 2019, ha consolidado un proyecto que tiene como objetivo mejorar temas democráticos a partir de cinco áreas de acción, que son:
1) Inclusión para la democracia a través de la educación electoral; iniciativas para promover la democracia y la participación;
2) Buenas prácticas electorales como forma de garantizar la integridad electoral;
3) Participación activa en la política de juventud; de mujeres y LGTBI+; de negros e indígenas;
4) Transparencia, control y la transmisión de información a la sociedad;
5) Integración con América Latina.

